feov-record: blue: record: dispute requires --dimension severity|likelihood|impact|complexity_cost (got "banana") — the orchestrator matches red's answer to blue's dispute on (gap_id, dimension) and then reads the gap's grade AT that dimension: an axis outside the four matches no answer and reads no grade, so the dispute auto-dockets and its accepted delta computes as zero

